    "type": "game",
    "name": "FLY GUYS",
    "steam_appid": 2602040,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602040/extras/8618f853e8065c0ab42b0debb9f24c45.avif?t=1753711375\" data-has-big width=800 height=596 /></span><i></i><br><br><br><i></i><br><br><br><i>FLY GUYS</i> is a 3D platformer open-world flying collectathon game. Play as a little owl guy named Fly Guy, or his partner in the sky, Fly Gal. Relax in this calming atmosphere surrounded by nature, and become a hero to all birds in The Archipelago!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602040/extras/ef070d1dd5ed6a0039c05d37f00326bb.avif?t=1753711375\" data-has-big width=800 height=559 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around to discover new locations and explore the map, searching for eggs in an effort to rescue them all. Take on flight challenges that take you through tight turns, deep dives, and long distances.<br><br><i>FLY GUYS</i> is a cozy adventure game that centers around collecting, exploration, fun flight, and memorable characters and moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many islands this world has to offer! From lush, green forests, to harsh, snow-covered tundras, <i>FLY GUYS</i> has a lot to love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602040/extras/9272526dbc2b7bfb04915fd6e4a3b4dc.avif?t=1753711375\" data-has-big width=800 height=741 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\udd5a\u00a0</u><strong>Fully Open World</strong> - Fly to ANY island right at the beginning of the game. No loading!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\udeb6\u00a0</u><strong>Collectables, Collectables!</strong> -\u00a0With collectable feathers, wearable accessories, and rare fish to find, there's an abundance of fun things to be on the lookout for!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\udd5a\u00a0</u><strong>Momentum-Based Flight -</strong>\u00a0Master momentum-based flight in <i>FLY GUYS</i>\u2014where speed, physics, airboosts, updrafts, and skill combine for exhilarating aerial freedom!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\udeb6\u00a0</u><strong>Day-Night Cycle</strong> - Experience the beauty of The Archipelago at all times of day. Special events may be only at specific times of day!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\udd5a\u00a0</u><strong>Exhilarating Flight-Based Challenges! -</strong>\u00a0To get each egg back to their families, Fly Guy/Gal take on fast-paced, exciting flight based challenges! These can range from precision ring challenges, to popping bubbles!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602040/extras/21e8485a4ed7434a740a1bf093826e8e.avif?t=1753711375\" data-has-big width=800 height=875 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602040/extras/8618f853e8065c0ab42b0debb9f24c45.avif?t=1753711375\" data-has-big width=800 height=596 /></span><i></i><br><br><br><i></i><br><br><br><i>FLY GUYS</i> is a 3D platformer open-world flying collectathon game. Play as a little owl guy named Fly Guy, or his partner in the sky, Fly Gal. Relax in this calming atmosphere surrounded by nature, and become a hero to all birds in The Archipelago!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602040/extras/ef070d1dd5ed6a0039c05d37f00326bb.avif?t=1753711375\" data-has-big width=800 height=559 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around to discover new locations and explore the map, searching for eggs in an effort to rescue them all. Take on flight challenges that take you through tight turns, deep dives, and long distances.<br><br><i>FLY GUYS</i> is a cozy adventure game that centers around collecting, exploration, fun flight, and memorable characters and moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the many islands this world has to offer! From lush, green forests, to harsh, snow-covered tundras, <i>FLY GUYS</i> has a lot to love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602040/extras/9272526dbc2b7bfb04915fd6e4a3b4dc.avif?t=1753711375\" data-has-big width=800 height=741 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\udd5a\u00a0</u><strong>Fully Open World</strong> - Fly to ANY island right at the beginning of the game. No loading!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\udeb6\u00a0</u><strong>Collectables, Collectables!</strong> -\u00a0With collectable feathers, wearable accessories, and rare fish to find, there's an abundance of fun things to be on the lookout for!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\udd5a\u00a0</u><strong>Momentum-Based Flight -</strong>\u00a0Master momentum-based flight in <i>FLY GUYS</i>\u2014where speed, physics, airboosts, updrafts, and skill combine for exhilarating aerial freedom!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\udeb6\u00a0</u><strong>Day-Night Cycle</strong> - Experience the beauty of The Archipelago at all times of day. Special events may be only at specific times of day!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\udd5a\u00a0</u><strong>Exhilarating Flight-Based Challenges! -</strong>\u00a0To get each egg back to their families, Fly Guy/Gal take on fast-paced, exciting flight based challenges! These can range from precision ring challenges, to popping bubbles!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2602040/extras/21e8485a4ed7434a740a1bf093826e8e.avif?t=1753711375\" data-has-big width=800 height=875 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "FLY GUYS is a 3D open-world flying collectathon game. Play as an owl named Fly Guy, or his love in the sky, Fly Gal, and relax in this cozy atmosphere surrounded by nature. Fly high to discover new locations and explore the map, searching for eggs to rescue them all. Take on challenges, and explore!",
